死后宫。李昭芸为了逆风翻盘，从拉着儿子一起减肥开始，利用时空超市，一次次打败虞贵妃的阴谋，太皇太后“中毒”事件、外邦来访事件、藩王谋逆事件，并且救下太皇太后和皇帝，保卫国土安全，百姓平安，最后赢得天下民心和皇帝的青睐。","series_id":"7559064335742422041","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106235735AE60A2C7B94EBF979540\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7559064335742422041\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03251329064369202,\\\"finish\\\":0.0026316738221794367,\\\"collect\\\":0.04146227985620499,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7359150052070618,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.13117145001888275,\\\"like\\\":0.06187598779797554,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.285854697227478}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7559064335742422041","play_cnt":46557,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"花生短剧","sub_title":"逆袭·女性成长","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":60,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5031,\"name\":\"逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5031&categoryName=逆袭&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5045,\"name\":\"女性成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5045&categoryName=女性成长&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5136,\"name\":\"宫斗宅斗\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5136&categoryName=宫斗宅斗&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5074,\"name\":\"奇幻脑洞\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5074&categoryName=奇幻脑洞&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5170,\"name\":\"穿书\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5170&categoryName=穿书&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5260,\"name\":\"大女主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?catego